===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic|often [[hyphenate]]d}} [[good|Good]], [[superior]], [[excellent]].
#: {{ux|en|He's doing a '''bang up''' job.}}

====Translations====
{{trans-top|superior, excellent}}
