===Verb===
{{en-verb|bangs up|banging up|banged up}}

# To [[damage]].
#: {{ux|en|He '''banged up''' his new car last night.}}
# To put someone in [[prison]].
#: {{ux|en|He was so drunk that the police '''banged''' him '''up''' for the night.}}

====Usage notes====
* In all senses the [[object]] of this verb may appear before or after the [[particle]] ''up''. However, if the object is a [[pronoun]], then it is placed before the particle.

